(30) United States person
The term “United States person” means—
    (A) a citizen or resident of the United States,
    (B) a domestic partnership,
    (C) a domestic corporation,
    (D) any estate (other than a foreign estate, within the meaning of paragraph (31)), and
    (E) any trust if—
        (i) a court within the United States is able to exercise primary supervision over the administration of the trust, and
        (ii) one or more United States persons have the authority to control all substantial decisions of the trust.

now this definition is self referential because the determination of the trust itself depends on being United States Person and Catala doesn't allow recursive types. One solution to cast it as a External Type but it there problems with that as well because they all the data needs to be provided externally.

how do I formalize this? being a trust for the purpose depends on the control itself being in hands of united states persons. If I define this as a or the trust as some determination from some input that itself will need the type united states person to be determined. Further B, C, and D are determinations in themselves.

Furthermore, the determination of which trust qualifies depends on "substantial control" under one or more United States person. Suppose that one trust is controlled by another, then it such a case the parent trust would have to be a qualified. This will lead to recursion until a trust is no longer controlled by another trust by rather by any one of A, B, C, or D and then based on that we have to walk back towards. 

Other problem is there is not definition or declaration of what "the authority to control all substantial decisions of the trust." mean? There is no method to compute this. At best if I am willing to formalize this as some external type then I can have a function that can flatten the Trust structure and determine if it qualifies or not based on its ancestors or else the best I can think of is just an enum and we leave it to the user to choose whatever applies. 

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration UnitedStatesPerson:
  -- CitizenOrResident
  -- DomesticPartnership
  -- DomesticCorporation
  -- QualifiedEstate
  -- QualifiedTrust
```

